OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster who claimed to be a lord
OL,4,Aand doctor jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "compulsive fraudster" who falsely
OL,7,Fclaimed to be a lord and a doctor and
OL,8,Fset up a number of fake companies has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FDarren Anderson, from Gamston in
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, set up 13 fraudulent
OL,13,Fcompanies between 2022 and 2023,
OL,14,Fleaving businesses and individuals more
OL,15,Fthan #200,000 out of pocket.
OL,17,FThe 43-year-old, who went by names such
OL,18,Fas Lord Timothy Ahlbeck and the 18th
OL,19,FDuke of Ahlbeck, was also the director
OL,20,Fof five companies while banned and
OL,21,Fstole from properties he had rented.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
