OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster who claimed to be a lord
OL,4,Aand doctor jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday at Nottingham Crown Court,
OL,7,FAnderson, of Bassingfield Lane, was
OL,8,Fjailed for four years after admitting
OL,9,F16 offences.
